subject: feat(combos): add Smart Router (System One) with adaptive session stickiness (#4975)

- Add smart combo routing strategy powered by in-process System One evaluation
- Support adaptive session stickiness (Smart Switch, Strict Lock, Per-Turn) to retain prompt cache
- Introduce SmartPolicyModal and System One router picker in dashboard combos
- Include automated unit tests covering state extraction, policies, and resilience


